REMASTERED LINUX EDITION:
Remastered by MD Shifat Bin Siddique Urfi (DMC, K-79) and MD Mehedi Hasan (BUET, 2021-22)
for modern Linux distributions including Ubuntu 24.04, 26.04, Debian 12 (Bookworm), and Debian 13 (Trixie).
Features standalone Windows-style floating sticky TopBar, standalone Avro Pad with live phonetic
composition, Unicode <-> Bijoy converter, visual layout viewer, and resilient IBus integration.

